{"c":[{"id":"8879531bae2973c5","sum":"write_nap rejects intersecting digest sets; same-text loose notes heal to the later file (#77). fold_request quotes text only; grain/date on wake/recall/zoom; ids on Run:. -h documents --path. Windows: stock AGENTS.md stays Unix, unadvertised; Run: prints host invoke; CRLF->LF","tree":{"c":[{"id":"c0b91843eda5c237","sum":"write_nap rejects intersecting digest sets; identical loose notes heal to the later filename (#77). fold_request quotes caption/note text only; grain and date stay on wake, recall, zoom; ids stay on Run:. No nested stores: root wake omits catalog how-to; -h documents --path.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"edb0ea0fb012e074","sum":"write_nap rejects intersecting digest sets; identical loose notes heal to the later filename (#77)","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T223329Z-dff4d96e7ee27dcc","text":"write_nap rejects any intersecting digest sets; two identical loose notes collapse on heal to the later filename (#77)","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T230843Z-3ad41bcf17625899","text":"heal-same-text archived to memory-bank/archive/bug-fixes/20260829-heal-same-text.md; PR #79","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ec999124e9bbfbf6","sum":"fold_request quotes caption/note text only; grain and date stay on wake, recall, and zoom; ids stay on Run:. With no nested stores, root wake omits catalog how-to; -h still documents --path.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T232955Z-ce112a8dc2e0252b","text":"fold_request quotes caption/note text only; grain and date stay on wake, recall, zoom; ids stay on Run:","type":"note"},{"name":"20260903T213935Z-aa0196fbeb246257","text":"Root wake omits catalog how-to when no nested stores exist; operator -h still documents --path.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"34adeab4ac984330","sum":"Windows: AGENTS.md clone-portable, stock stays Unix; do not advertise native support (no argv0 runs in both cmd.exe and Unix). Usage/Run: print host invoke (sys.executable). Lock and CRLF-on-read let a shop patch its bootstrap; no consumer .gitattributes, no store lock file.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"819660f9289867d7","sum":"Windows: AGENTS.md clone-portable (no C:\\ argv0; not pasteable). Usage/Run may print host invoke. note/nap crash on import fcntl; pathlib --path and python .summem/summem work; no store lock file. No consumer .gitattributes; canonicalize CRLF on read; punt this-repo git symlink.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T005128Z-e234bb60ff9049ba","text":"Windows: AGENTS.md stays clone-portable (no C:\\ argv0); Usage/Run: may print host invoke. note/nap crash on import fcntl; pathlib --path and python .summem/summem work; do not flock a store lock file.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T010940Z-0a0daf8323fd00b0","text":"Windows port: no consumer .gitattributes — canonicalize CRLF on read for digest/JSON; punt this-repo git symlink; AGENTS.md is not a pasteable argv0.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"597efaa40d5ae61b","sum":"Windows: do not advertise native support (no argv0 runs in both cmd.exe and Unix shells); internals (lock, CRLF) let a Windows shop patch its bootstrap. Usage/Run: print the host invoke (sys.executable); stock AGENTS.md stays Unix.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T011527Z-a89670306f0346b1","text":"Do not advertise native Windows: no argv0 is a command in both cmd.exe and a Unix shell. Ceiling is internals (lock, CRLF) so a Windows-only shop can patch their bootstrap.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T011559Z-5a487f135c8e6892","text":"Windows: print host-specific invoke on Usage/Run: (sys.executable). Stock AGENTS.md stays Unix; only a shop that patched the bootstrap will see the Windows lines.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"c1b15455613b38c1","sum":"CRLF as LF on read. Lock: flock naps/, else runtime-dir; msvcrt 30s, slack 1e-9. Never monkeypatch os.name to nt. python .summem/summem wake; names no path. Usage bare Unix, python Windows. N: ./path (note +1, nap leaves once). --path walks up. Nap line sequences; Saved. is ACK.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5c6784a8f49cfad6","sum":"Windows: CRLF canonicalized on read; lock is naps/ flock else runtime-dir file, msvcrt wait 30s monotonic (test allows 1e-9 slack). Bootstrap wake is python .summem/summem wake; Usage bare on Unix, python-prefixed on Windows. Never monkeypatch os.name to nt on Linux.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"278f6b06c3a7df2f","sum":"Windows: CRLF canonicalized on read; lock is naps/ flock, else a runtime-dir file (fcntl then msvcrt); msvcrt wait is 30s monotonic elapsed, waited += 0.01 is backoff only. Do not monkeypatch os.name to nt on Linux (WindowsPath crash).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T014746Z-2240e9a38cbd40b5","text":"Windows: CRLF canonicalize on read; lock is naps/ flock else runtime-dir file (fcntl then msvcrt); do not monkeypatch os.name to nt on Linux (pathlib WindowsPath crash).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T153140Z-a4f303a1f756c0ca","text":"msvcrt lock wait is 30s monotonic elapsed; waited += 0.01 is backoff only, not the deadline","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"2bc6b5f9386d965f","sum":"Bootstrap wake is python .summem/summem wake; Usage is bare on Unix, python-prefixed on Windows. msvcrt lock-deadline test allows 1e-9 slack on sum(sleeps): 3.12+ can land at 30.000000000000007.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T234518Z-6ee83d5cd5f8d318","text":"Bootstrap wake is python .summem/summem wake; Usage is bare on Unix, python-prefixed on Windows","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T234852Z-a4967a2ed0a2a1f1","text":"msvcrt lock-deadline test must allow 1e-9 slack on sum(sleeps); 3.12+ can land at 30.000000000000007","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"2dfeefe80535b269","sum":"First wake is python .summem/summem wake; the intro names no invoked-as path. Catalog lines are N: ./path, N a count from one ls-files pass (loose note +1, nap stem its leaves once). --path walks up to the nearest store. Usage nap line is sequencing only; Saved. owns the ACK.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"8a207191a07b0eec","sum":"First wake is python .summem/summem wake; the prompt intro names no invoked-as path. Root catalog lines are N: ./path, N the filename leaf grain from one ls-files pass (loose note +1, nap stem once).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260911T001036Z-0b56b4cb6829c2f7","text":"prompt_text intro is managed through SumMem only; first-wake is python .summem/summem wake; no invoked-as path","type":"note"},{"name":"20260915T225419Z-4b8f0ca4ed1bdaaf","text":"Root catalog lines are N: ./path; N is filename leaf grain from the same ls-files pass (loose note +1, nap stem once). Path is the ./ token.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"784324e867a813e8","sum":"Catalog N: is a count; --path on note, nap, recall, zoom walks up to the nearest store. Usage nap line is sequencing only; Saved. owns the ACK (no already-stored or do-not-retry).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260915T230226Z-c1e5723514aa52a8","text":"Catalog how-to: N: is a count; note --path <file> walks up to the nearest store. Same --path on nap, recall, zoom.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260915T230920Z-fd73dce7353c1e73","text":"Usage nap line is sequencing only; Saved. owns ACK (no already-stored / do-not-retry).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
